---
import { getLangFromUrl } from "../i18n/utils";

const lang = getLangFromUrl(Astro.url);
const personalImageAlt = "Ángel Porlán";
---

<article
  class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-8 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 md:flex-row"
>
  <div
    class="[&>p]:mb-4 [&>p>strong]:text-yellow-500 dark:[&>p>strong]:text-yellow-100 [&>p>strong]:font-normal [&>p>strong]:font-mono text-pretty order-2 md:order-1"
  >
    {
      lang === "es" ? (
        <>
          <p>
            Soy desarrollador <strong>full stack con mentalidad de producto</strong>. No solo construyo aplicaciones, sino soluciones que aportan <strong>valor real</strong>.
          </p>

          <p>
            Mi enfoque actual está en combinar <strong>desarrollo web con inteligencia artificial</strong>, explorando cómo los modelos de lenguaje y los sistemas automatizados pueden integrarse en productos útiles.
          </p>

          <p>
            He desarrollado aplicaciones completas desde cero, abarcando arquitectura, backend, frontend y experiencia de usuario. Esto me permite entender el producto de forma global y tomar <strong>decisiones técnicas con impacto</strong>.
          </p>

          <p>
            Actualmente compagino mi trabajo profesional con el desarrollo de <strong>proyectos propios basados en IA</strong>, con el objetivo de evolucionar hacia roles donde la ingeniería y la inteligencia artificial convergen.
          </p>
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          <p>
            I am a <strong>full stack developer with a product mindset</strong>. I don't just build applications; I construct solutions that deliver <strong>real value</strong>.
          </p>

          <p>
            My current focus is on combining <strong>web development with artificial intelligence</strong>, exploring how language models and automated systems can be integrated into useful products.
          </p>

          <p>
            I have developed complete applications from scratch, spanning architecture, backend, frontend, and user experience. This allows me to understand the product globally and make <strong>technical decisions with a direct impact</strong>.
          </p>

          <p>
            Currently, I combine my professional work with the development of <strong>my own AI-based projects</strong>, with the goal of evolving into roles where engineering and artificial intelligence converge.
          </p>
        </>
      )
    }
  </div>

  <img
    width="200"
    height="200"
    src="/fondoblanco.jpeg"
    alt={personalImageAlt}
    class="order-1 object-cover w-64 h-full p-1 md:order-2 rotate-3 lg:p-2 lg:w-64 aspect-square rounded-2xl bg-black/20 dark:bg-yellow-500/5 ring-1 ring-black/70 dark:ring-white/20"
    style="object-position: 50% 50%"
  />
</article>
